   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2017-02-07",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Hazardous Waste (Regulation of Exports and Imports) Amendment Bill 2016 and Levy Bill 2016 implement Australia's Basel Convention obligations, allow full cost recovery for permitting, and lift the $8,000 cap on waste imports/exports to ensure cost recovery, while the speaker also urged reducing the $500 billion national debt and returning the budget to surplus."
  }
